  "plot_summary": "[HANG0 * Paul Gambaccini's letter printed in [LINK:1963:ASM_7|ASM #7] was perhaps the first case of calling the competition \"echh\" - that's a phrase we'll be hearing more of!\n\n[HANG0 * The Announcements at the end of [LINK:1963:ASM_7|ASM #7] actually asks permission to <i>discontinue the letters page</i> in ASM, indicating that it takes a good while to put together and suggests that comments about <i>all</i> magazines be instead directed to the FF mag, indicating:&nbsp; <i>We'll do nothing till we hear from you, so let us know.&nbsp; But, as a special favor, we hope you'll tell us you don't mind.</i>  (Boy, I'll get <i>that</i> went over like a lead balloon - <i>wow</i>!)",
